    "description": "Explore medical care in Malaysia with appointment, travel and stay coordination from Bangladesh. MediConnect design preview.",
    "currentNav": "/hospitals",
    "main": "<section class=\"intro wrap\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">HOSPITALS IN MALAYSIA</p><h1>Find a place to<br><span class=\"blue\">begin your care.</span></h1><p class=\"lead\">Explore hospital information, international patient support and practical questions for your visit.</p></section><section class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"filter-bar glass\"><label><span>Search hospitals</span><input id=\"hospital-search\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Hospital name…\"></label><label><span>Location</span><select id=\"hospital-city\"><option>All locations</option><option>Kuala Lumpur</option><option>Sunway City</option></select></label><span id=\"hospital-count\" aria-live=\"polite\">4 hospitals</span></div><div class=\"hospital-grid directory\"><article class=\"hospital-card\" data-city=\"Sunway City\" data-name=\"sunway medical centre\"><a aria-label='Explore Sunway Medical Centre' class='hospital-art blue' href='/sunway'><span class=\"monogram\">S</span><span class=\"art-caption\">Sunway City <span>↗</span></span></a><div class=\"hospital-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">International patient planning</p><h3><a href='/sunway'>Sunway Medical Centre</a></h3><p>Explore a medical campus in Sunway City, with dedicated information for international patients, care coordinators and visit planning.</p><a class='text-link' href='/sunway'>View hospital <span>↗</span></a></div></article><article class=\"hospital-card\" data-city=\"Kuala Lumpur\" data-name=\"gleneagles hospital kuala lumpur\"><a aria-label='Explore Gleneagles Hospital Kuala Lumpur' class='hospital-art sage' href='/gleneagles'><span class=\"monogram\">G</span><span class=\"art-caption\">Kuala Lumpur <span>↗</span></span></a><div class=\"hospital-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Specialist care in Kuala Lumpur</p><h3><a href='/gleneagles'>Gleneagles Hospital Kuala Lumpur</a></h3><p>A hospital on Jalan Ampang with medical specialties, health screening and resources for patients visiting from overseas.</p><a class='text-link' href='/gleneagles'>View hospital <span>↗</span></a></div></article><article class=\"hospital-card\" data-city=\"Kuala Lumpur\" data-name=\"pantai hospital kuala lumpur\"><a aria-label='Explore Pantai Hospital Kuala Lumpur' class='hospital-art sand' href='/pantai'><span class=\"monogram\">P</span><span class=\"art-caption\">Kuala Lumpur <span>↗</span></span></a><div class=\"hospital-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Medical and surgical specialties</p><h3><a href='/pantai'>Pantai Hospital Kuala Lumpur</a></h3><p>Explore Pantai’s specialist services, cancer care information and health screening options in Kuala Lumpur.</p><a class='text-link' href='/pantai'>View hospital <span>↗</span></a></div></article><article class=\"hospital-card\" data-city=\"Kuala Lumpur\" data-name=\"prince court medical centre\"><a aria-label='Explore Prince Court Medical Centre' class='hospital-art lavender' href='/prince-court'><span class=\"monogram\">PC</span><span class=\"art-caption\">Kuala Lumpur <span>↗</span></span></a><div class=\"hospital-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">International patient support</p><h3><a href='/prince-court'>Prince Court Medical Centre</a></h3><p>Explore hospital services and the Premier Lounge, which supports international visitors with appointment and concierge enquiries.</p><a class='text-link' href='/prince-court'>View hospital <span>↗</span></a></div></article></div><p id=\"hospital-empty\" hidden>No hospitals match. Try a different name or location.</p><p class=\"caption\">Profiles are based on official hospital information. Listings do not imply a confirmed partnership. The coloured profile artwork is a design motif, not a hospital photograph.</p></section><section class=\"wrap section split\"><h2>Not sure which<br>hospital to explore?</h2><div><p>Tell us the care area or appointment you are considering. We can help coordinate the next enquiry.</p><a class='button ' href='/plan?help=not-sure'>Help me get started<span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></section>",
    "closing": "<div><p class=\"eyebrow\">A LITTLE CLARITY GOES A LONG WAY</p><h2>Your next step.<br><span class=\"blue\">A conversation.</span></h2></div><div><p>Tell us what you need. We’ll help you understand where to begin.</p><a class='button ' href='/plan'>Plan My Visit<span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a class='text-link' href='/contact'>Or request a callback →</a></div>"
