  "services": {
    "route": "/services",
    "title": "Our Services | MediConnect Malaysia",
    "description": "Explore medical care in Malaysia with appointment, travel and stay coordination from Bangladesh. MediConnect design preview.",
    "currentNav": "/services",
    "main": "<section class=\"intro wrap\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICAL HELP AT EVERY STAGE</p><h1>Care is only part<br><span class=\"blue\">of the journey.</span></h1><p class=\"lead\">From the first hospital enquiry to the everyday details of your stay, we help connect the arrangements.</p></section><section class=\"wrap service-list\"><article><span class=\"service-number\">01</span><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Hospital appointments</p><h2>A clearer way to begin.</h2></div><div><p>Tell us the hospital or care area you are considering. We help coordinate the appointment request and information the hospital needs.</p><p class=\"small\">The hospital confirms the specialist and appointment.</p><a class='text-link' href='/plan'>Ask about this support ↗</a></div></article><article><span class=\"service-number\">02</span><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Treatment & estimates</p><h2>Make room for a plan.</h2></div><div><p>We help coordinate report-sharing, treatment enquiries and hospital-issued estimates, including enquiries about surgery.</p><p class=\"small\">Clinical recommendations and admission decisions come from the hospital.</p><a class='text-link' href='/plan'>Ask about this support ↗</a></div></article><article><span class=\"service-number\">03</span><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Visa assistance</p><h2>Prepare the paperwork.</h2></div><div><p>We help you understand the documents requested for your travel arrangements and coordinate hospital documentation where applicable.</p><p class=\"small\">The relevant authority decides visa applications.</p><a class='text-link' href='/plan'>Ask about this support ↗</a></div></article><article><span class=\"service-number\">04</span><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Airport & local transport</p><h2>A considered arrival.</h2></div><div><p>Discuss airport pickup, luggage, accompanying family and any mobility needs before travelling.</p><p class=\"small\">Transport, availability and charges are agreed for your visit.</p><a class='text-link' href='/plan'>Ask about this support ↗</a></div></article><article><span class=\"service-number\">05</span><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Accommodation & family</p><h2>Space to feel settled.</h2></div><div><p>We help coordinate accommodation enquiries around your hospital, family size and everyday needs.</p><p class=\"small\">Room availability, facilities and prices are confirmed individually.</p><a class='text-link' href='/plan'>Ask about this support ↗</a></div></article><article><span class=\"service-number\">06</span><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Follow-up coordination</p><h2>Stay connected after your visit.</h2></div><div><p>We help coordinate further hospital enquiries and appointment arrangements after you return home.</p><p class=\"small\">Follow-up instructions and clinical advice come from your treating team.</p><a class='text-link' href='/plan'>Ask about this support ↗</a></div></article></section><section class=\"care-section\"><div class=\"wrap section\"><h2>People at the<br>heart of the journey.</h2><div class=\"care-grid\"><figure><img class=\"\" src=\"/assets/clinical.webp\" alt=\"Illustrative nurse caring for a patient\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption><span>01 / PERSONAL ATTENTION</span><h3>Someone who takes the time.</h3></figcaption></figure><figure><img class=\"\" src=\"/assets/technology.webp\" alt=\"Illustrative modern diagnostic equipment\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption><span>02 / MODERN FACILITIES</span><h3>A clearer picture of your care.</h3></figcaption></figure><figure><img class=\"\" src=\"/assets/recovery.webp\" alt=\"Illustrative patient resting with family\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption><span>03 / FAMILY COMFORT</span><h3>Room for reassurance.</h3></figcaption></figure></div><p class=\"caption\">AI-created care scenes. Not photographs of a named hospital, actual patients or treatment outcomes.</p></div></section>",
    "closing": "<div><p class=\"eyebrow\">A LITTLE CLARITY GOES A LONG WAY</p><h2>Your next step.<br><span class=\"blue\">A conversation.</span></h2></div><div><p>Tell us what you need. We’ll help you understand where to begin.</p><a class='button ' href='/plan'>Plan My Visit<span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a class='text-link' href='/contact'>Or request a callback →</a></div>"
  },
