    "currentNav": "/why-malaysia",
    "main": "<section class=\"intro wrap\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">A DESTINATION WORTH EXPLORING</p><h1>Your care.<br><span class=\"blue\">A new perspective.</span></h1><p class=\"lead\">Explore Malaysia with a clearer picture of the hospitals, practical arrangements and family support you may need.</p></section><div class=\"destination-art wrap\"><div><span>MALAYSIA</span><h2>A little closer<br>to feeling at home.</h2></div></div><section class=\"wrap section split\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">MAKE AN INFORMED CHOICE</p><h2>Choose with<br>your needs in mind.</h2><p>Start with the hospital and specialist relevant to your needs. Then consider the everyday details that make the journey work for you.</p><a class='button ' href='/hospitals'>Explore Hospitals<span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div><div class=\"editorial-list\"><article><span>01</span><div><h3>Explore specialist care</h3><p>Review hospital departments and ask which specialist should assess your reports.</p></div></article><article><span>02</span><div><h3>Plan for your family</h3><p>Discuss nearby accommodation, accompanying family and the support you need day to day.</p></div></article><article><span>03</span><div><h3>Ask about familiar comforts</h3><p>Check food choices, prayer facilities and language assistance with your hospital and accommodation.</p></div></article><article><span>04</span><div><h3>Understand the whole visit</h3><p>Clarify the appointment, hospital estimate, expected stay and follow-up before confirming travel.</p></div></article></div></section><section class=\"care-section\"><div class=\"wrap section\"><div class=\"section-top\"><h2>The details that<br>make a difference.</h2><p>Facilities and arrangements vary.<br>We help you ask the right questions.</p></div><div class=\"faqs\"><details><summary>Will language assistance be available?<span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><p>Ask the hospital which languages it supports and whether an interpreter needs to be arranged in advance.</p></details><details><summary>Can I stay near my hospital?<span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><p>Discuss your preferred room type, family needs, accessibility and transport. Availability and rates are confirmed for your dates.</p></details><details><summary>Is Malaysia the right option for every patient?<span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><p>The choice depends on the medical assessment, hospital suitability, budget and practical circumstances. Discuss your options with the treating team.</p></details><details><summary>How can MediConnect help before I choose?<span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><p>We coordinate hospital enquiries and help clarify appointments, estimates and travel arrangements. Clinical decisions remain with the hospital.</p></details></div></div></section>",
    "closing": "<div><p class=\"eyebrow\">A LITTLE CLARITY GOES A LONG WAY</p><h2>Your next step.<br><span class=\"blue\">A conversation.</span></h2></div><div><p>Tell us what you need. We’ll help you understand where to begin.</p><a class='button ' href='/plan'>Plan My Visit<span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a class='text-link' href='/contact'>Or request a callback →</a></div>"
